    "coherence": [
      "Capture Photon statics, offline byte, room, client, dictionary and dictionary count/freeCount. After reading all payload, require same statics/room/offline/client/players and count/freeCount/version. No room/player identities are read.",
      "For offline require offlineMode==1 and room.isOffline==1. For online require offlineMode==0, client.state==9 and room.isOffline==0. Never infer singleplayer from player count.",
      "Player count=count-freeCount must be 1..4. count/freeCount must be nonnegative with freeCount<=count and count bounded (e.g. 16). Read dictionary version+44 for consistency. maxPlayers byte must be 1..4.",
      "Photon loading byte==1 => Loading. Room absent or client not joined => Menu or connecting; do not surface stale LevelValues.",
      "Ingame requires valid live Unity objects LevelController and GameController and mutual links LC+88==GC, GC+F0==LC, plus parent-owned local-player room evidence. If absent with room active => Lobby (unless loading).",
      "LevelValues is DontDestroyOnLoad and retains map/difficulty across menu transitions. Only publish contract map/room under active scene/player gate. Lobby selected map/difficulty are possible but require validated current lobby UI source; do not use stale values blindly.",
      "Map/difficulty can be independently missing; fail closed and clear affected text. Current difficulty is +38; +40 contains stale custom backup.",
      "Class names and strings must be bounded and exact expected class validated. For Room namespace Photon.Realtime; PhotonNetwork namespace Photon.Pun.",
      "LevelValues +30/+34 event fields are not used by canonical Map name getter; use proven SeasonalEventController flow described in seasonalMapName or ordinary name as fallback."
    ],
